# HOWTO: build a USL, materialize it to {{STORE_NAME}}, and prove it

Fifteen steps from an unpacked package to a verified Parquet object in a bucket,
ending with the report to send back.
Each step has the command to copy and the output to expect. Replace anything in
angle brackets with your own value. Timestamps, ids and file names in the output
will differ.

Run every command from the folder that holds `systems/`, `scripts/` and
`open_data/`: the package folder, or the repository root.

Commands that start with `.venv/bin/python` need the venv from step 2. Commands
that start with `python3` use only the standard library, or switch into the venv
themselves when they need it.

